Template: sysible/tools
Type: multiselect
Choices: terraform, vault, consul, nomad, packer, boundary, aws-cli
Default:
Description: Optional software to install
 These tools are NOT bundled in the Sysible Workstation image, so they are
 offered here as a choice. HashiCorp's tools (terraform, vault, consul, nomad,
 packer, boundary) are BUSL-1.1 licensed, not open source; selecting them means
 you accept HashiCorp's licence (https://www.hashicorp.com/bsl). aws-cli is
 installed from Amazon's official channel.
 .
 Anything you select is installed automatically the first time this system boots
 with a working network connection. OpenTofu (the open Terraform drop-in),
 gcloud, the Azure CLI, Docker, kubectl, Helm and Ansible are already included.
 .
 You can add or remove these tools at any time later with:  sudo sysible-tools
